      "oscal-version": "1.1.2",
      "remarks": "Includes only Supporter-tier clauses. Derived from Annex B (printed pp. 30–111) of the CSA Cybersecurity Certification: Cyber Trust mark document (v202504), using the \"Classical cybersecurity\" column only; cloud, OT and AI security columns are excluded. Clauses stating that the domain is not assessable for the tier are not requirements and are omitted. Statements reproduce the source wording.",
